  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760008,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 180 Tunes: A Commodore 64 Darts Challenge!\n\nStep up to the oche in *180 Tunes*, a fast-paced and addictive darts game for the Commodore 64!  Compete in a thrilling championship tournament against a roster of quirky opponents, culminating in a showdown against the formidable World Champion, Jammy Jim.  Master the classic darts rules – subtract your score from 501, aiming for a perfect finish on a double – and prove your skill to climb the ranks.\n\nThe tournament structure is intense! Starting at the quarter-finals, you’ll face best-of-three matches to advance, battling your way through the semi-finals before finally confronting Jammy Jim in the ultimate final.  A single leg victory against him secures your championship title! \n\nBut the fun doesn't stop there! Challenge a friend in head-to-head multiplayer or test your accuracy in the frantic \"Round the Clock\" mode, hitting every number on the dartboard from 20 to 1 against the clock.  *180 Tunes* delivers authentic darts action and addictive gameplay, perfect for honing your skills and becoming a darts champion!"
    },
